OL,3,GNEWSAHospital failed to report sexual  
OL,4,Aassault claims                         
OL,6,FA private mental health hospital failed
OL,7,Fto report allegations of rape and      
OL,8,Fsexual assault to its local authority, 
OL,9,Fa Care Quality Commission (CQC) report 
OL,10,Fhas revealed.                          
OL,12,FThe Billingham Grange Independent      
OL,13,FHospital in Stockton was given an      
OL,14,Finadequate rating for safety following 
OL,15,Fits most recent inspection in February.
OL,17,FThe CQC said staff did not always take 
OL,18,Fappropriate action on safeguarding     
OL,19,Fissues and "incidents, including       
OL,20,Fallegations of abuse", were not always 
OL,21,Freported in line with legal            
OL,22,Frequirements.                          
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
