OL,3,GNEWSAHospital failed to report sexual  
OL,4,Aassault claims                         
OL,6,FBarchester Healthcare Homes, which runs
OL,7,Fthe site, did not comment on specific  
OL,8,Fissues raised in the report but said it
OL,9,Fwould welcome another inspection.      
